  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "BER: Allow unknown OCTETSTRINGs to be filtered",
  "description": "BER registers two fields for unknown OCTETSTRINGS, one for when the\nunknown OCTET STRING looks like it could be BER encoded data, and\na preference is enabled to try to decode it that way. They both use\nthe same filter abbreviation.\n\nFor compatibility, instead of the latter one being a FT_NONE, make\nit a FT_BYTES with BASE_NO_DISPLAY_VALUE. That makes everything look\nthe same as before, except that the types are compatible so that they\ncan be filtered (and changing the preference doesn't change the\nfilter result.)\n\nThis removes another case of fields with the same filter abbreviation\nbeing non-compatible.",
  "state": "merged",
